// the message gets, which attempt it was, the retry instant that result
// schedules (waiting only), and the (source, destination, nonce) triple a
// success consumes. Every processing path builds one and hands it to
// commitOutcome, so the rule for how a result is persisted and then reflected
// onto the live record lives in exactly one place.
